<title>GERMANY: MG says 95/96 pretax profit up 70 pct.</title>
<headline>MG says 95/96 pretax profit up 70 pct.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Business year to September 30, 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of marks unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group pre-tax profit		     292     vs 171</p>
<p>    Group sales				  15,800  vs 17,600</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the German diversified engineering and trading group is Metallgesellschaft AG. The company said in a mandatory statement that all subsidiaries made a positive contribution to profits and that the decline in sales was as planned.</p>
<p>Metallgesellschaft, rescued from the brink of bankruptcy in 1993, also said its financial situation had improved in 1995/1996. The group's equity capital ratio rose to 6.7 percent from 2.2 percent and bank debt was further reduced, it said.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
